若当 $x \rightarrow 0$ 时, $\alpha(x), \beta(x)$ 是非零无穷小量,则以下的命题中,

(1) 若 $\alpha(x) \sim \beta(x)$, 则 $\alpha^2(x) \sim \beta^2(x)$;

(2) 若 $\alpha^2(x) \sim \beta^2(x)$, 则 $\alpha(x) \sim \beta(x)$;

(3) 若 $\alpha(x) \sim \beta(x)$, 则 $\alpha(x)-\beta(x)=o(\alpha(x))$;

(4) 若 $\alpha(x)-\beta(x)=o(\alpha(x))$, 则 $\alpha(x) \sim \beta(x)$
真命题的序号为 $(\quad)$

已知二次型 $f\left(x_1, x_2, x_3\right)=3 x_1^2+4 x_2^2+3 x_3^2+2 x_1 x_3$

(1) 求正交矩阵 $\boldsymbol{Q}$,使正交变换 $\boldsymbol{x}=\boldsymbol{Q y}$ 将二次型 $f\left(x_1, x_2, x_3\right)$ 化为标准形;

(2) 证明 $\displaystyle \min _{\boldsymbol{x} \neq 0} \frac{f(\boldsymbol{x})}{\boldsymbol{x}^{\mathrm{T}} \boldsymbol{x}}=2$

已知可微函数 $f(u, v)$ 满足 $\displaystyle \frac{\partial f(u, v)}{\partial u}-\frac{\partial f(u, v)}{\partial v}=2(u-v) \mathrm{e}^{-(u+v)}$, 且 $f(u, 0)$ $=u^2 \mathrm{e}^{-u}$.
( I ) 记 $g(x, y)=f(x, y-x)$, 求 $\displaystyle \frac{\partial g(x, y)}{\partial x}$;
(II) 求 $f(u, v)$ 的表达式与极值
